.TH TASK-MAPS 1 "October 2026" "task-maps 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
task-maps \- T.A.S.K. Maps & GPS: offline maps, map downloads, GPS, waypoints and tracks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B task-maps
[\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR \fIPATH\fR] [\fB\-\-windowed\fR | \fB\-\-fullscreen\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Native Qt (PySide6) map application of T.A.S.K. \(em Tactical Access Support Kit. It renders
raster MBTiles files offline with its own renderer, downloads map areas from tile sources whose
terms permit offline use (rate-limited, resumable), imports MBTiles files without network, shows
the GPS position from gpsd (read-only JSON on 127.0.0.1:2947; the serial device is never opened)
and keeps waypoints and recorded tracks with GPX 1.1 import and export.
.PP
Bulk downloading from tile.openstreetmap.org is refused (OSMF Tile Usage Policy).
It never runs as root and only one instance runs per user.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-data\-dir " " \fIPATH\fR
Absolute data folder for this run (maps, download jobs, waypoints).
.TP
.B \-\-windowed
Start in a normal window (default: maximized).
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Start fullscreen.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/task-maps/
Default data folder ($XDG_DATA_HOME/task-maps): maps/*.mbtiles (downloaded, one file per source),
maps/imported/*.mbtiles, jobs.sqlite, waypoints.sqlite. Kept on upgrade and on package removal.
.TP
.I ~/.config/task-maps/settings.json
Settings (data folder, coordinate format, cache size).
.TP
.I ~/.config/task-maps/sources.d/*.toml
User tile sources (see /usr/share/doc/task-maps/SOURCES-POLICY.md).
.TP
.I ~/.config/task-maps/keys.toml
API keys (mode 0600; never logged).
.TP
.I /usr/share/task-maps/sources.d/*.toml
Packaged tile sources.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpsd (8),
.BR task-launcher (1)
